{"slug":"Universal-Script-Camera-Noclip-7433","_id":"64ec88832a98dcdec01496f1","title":"Camera Noclip","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":0},"features":"This is a basic script that allows you to noclip through parts and terrain with your camera.\n\nWorks in auto-exec\nWorks on any exec that supports getgc(), setconstant and getconstants\n\nShowcase of it being used with my Hide Parts Obscuring Camera script: https://streamable.com/gos11t\n\n(Link to said script: https://scriptblox.com/script/Universal-Script-Making-Parts-Blocking-Character-Invisible-7432)","tags":["camera noclip","camera","camera clip","look through walls"],"script":"if not game:IsLoaded() then\n    game.Loaded:wait()\nend\n\nlocal Players = game:GetService(\"Players\")\nlocal LocalPlayer = Players.LocalPlayer\nlocal PopperClient = LocalPlayer:WaitForChild(\"PlayerScripts\").PlayerModule.CameraModule.ZoomController.Popper\n\nfor i, v in next, getgc() do\n    if getfenv(v).script == PopperClient and typeof(v) == \"function\" then\n        for i2, v2 in next, debug.getconstants(v) do\n            if tonumber(v2) == 0.25 then\n                debug.setconstant(v, i2, 0)\n            elseif tonumber(v2) == 0 then\n                debug.setconstant(v, i2, 0.25)\n            end\n        end\n    end\nend","owner":{"_id":"64e333e865fb04d1b2d801b0","username":"Amiriki","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/645a07d109d6df3d306ff4a0cafb74738a20a517ecece9b1c308098f5d896c6e.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/64e333e865fb04d1b2d801b0-1692611642845.png"},"status":"offline","id":"64e333e865fb04d1b2d801b0","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":5},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/645a07d109d6df3d306ff4a0cafb74738a20a517ecece9b1c308098f5d896c6e.webp","